it won't be that bad.

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:20.310
Trump for four years might even get us a true
progressive in 2020 that we would all be happy

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:21.310
with.

00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:22.310
Trump will shake things up.

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:25.150
He'll sort of bring a different approach.

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:29.040
It has certainly been different, there's no
doubt about that.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:35.880
But it has been an absolute and complete disaster,
regularly attacking in authoritarian fashion

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:40.670
