00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:48.180
There's no question whatsoever on the merits
whether he will or won't be.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:49.400
I don't know.

00:04:49.400 --> 00:04:50.510
Is it even worth doing?

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:56.560
I mean, listen, as I said before, there is
a duty to impeach if you believe an impeachable

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.310
